# 1.4.9: a phone playing into the FM-1 over USB (here a tone), recorded onto the reel with SOURCE USB (par189 5): a
# splice of it, and the reel plays it
wait 300
usbaudio 330
tap SEQ
wait 100
spin K1 5
expect par189 5
tap EDIT
wait 2000
tap REC
wait 200
expect reelspl 1
expect reelstate 0
shot usb.png
usbaudio 0
